{"identifier":"Sleepfor1950","title":"Sleep for Health","description":"Told from the viewpoint of a child, this film emphasizes that children should train themselves in good sleeping habits. In typical \"Goofus and Gallant\" style, it shows the advantages a well-rested kid has over his poor-sleeping classmate. D","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/Sleepfor1950/Sleepfor1950_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/Sleepfor1950","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/Sleepfor1950","durationMs":633001,"level":"B1","topic":"Health and hygiene;Dreams;Sleep","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Sleep for Health","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":33000,"endMs":38001,"text":"A new baby is an exciting addition to the family, but there are problems too."},{"startMs":39000,"endMs":47000,"text":"He's always asleep. When's he ever going to be any fun? All he ever does is eat and sleep."},{"startMs":49001,"endMs":54001,"text":"Yes, eat and sleep. And that's just about all you did too when you were a baby."},{"startMs":55000,"endMs":58001,"text":"You had to depend on your mother for all the things that you needed."},{"startMs":59000,"endMs":62001,"text":"She had to feed you, to bathe you, to put you down to sleep."},{"startMs":64001,"endMs":71000,"text":"As you grow older, you learn to do more and more things for yourself."},{"startMs":72000,"endMs":75000,"text":"Some of these things you do so often that they become habits."},{"startMs":76000,"endMs":81000,"text":"Everybody has habits. Dad likes to read his newspaper every evening in this same chair."},{"startMs":81000,"endMs":86001,"text":"It's one of his habits. Habits are things you do naturally without having to think about them."},{"startMs":87000,"endMs":92001,"text":"Martha first had to think each step when she tied a bow knot. Now she can do it easily and quickly."},{"startMs":97001,"endMs":103000,"text":"Regular habits make daily living much easier since they help us do things without having to think about them."},{"startMs":103001,"endMs":106001,"text":"Some of the habits you learn now may stay with you all your life."},{"startMs":108000,"endMs":111000,"text":"All right, children. It's time to get ready for bed."},{"startMs":111001,"endMs":113000,"text":"I'm almost through with this chapter, Mother."},{"startMs":116000,"endMs":121000,"text":"It's time for bed, Susie. You go right to sleep now."},{"startMs":122000,"endMs":126001,"text":"Getting ready for bed at a regular time is one of the most important habits you can learn."},{"startMs":127000,"endMs":130001,"text":"A quiet hour or two before bedtime is part of this habit."},{"startMs":131000,"endMs":134000,"text":"It makes you feel relaxed and sleepy. Ready for bed."},{"startMs":153001,"endMs":156000,"text":"Washing up is part of the going to bed habit."},{"startMs":156001,"endMs":160000,"text":"Any regular routine before bedtime helps you feel sleepy."},{"startMs":161000,"endMs":163000,"text":"Hanging up your clothes can be part of this routine."},{"startMs":163001,"endMs":166000,"text":"They'll air out overnight and be neat for tomorrow."},{"startMs":169001,"endMs":172000,"text":"Wearing the right kind of night clothes is important."},{"startMs":172001,"endMs":175001,"text":"David's pajamas fit him loosely and don't bind him around the waist."},{"startMs":176001,"endMs":182001,"text":"David likes to open his window when it isn't too cold for fresh air, but he's careful not to sleep in a draft."},{"startMs":184001,"endMs":186001,"text":"Of course, Martha has her own habits."},{"startMs":187000,"endMs":191000,"text":"Instead of opening her window, she gets fresh air by opening her door a bit."},{"startMs":192000,"endMs":195000,"text":"Good night, David. Good night, sis."},{"startMs":196000,"endMs":199000,"text":"David's bed is comfortable and the mattress isn't too soft."},{"startMs":199001,"endMs":202000,"text":"The covers on his bed are warm without being heavy."},{"startMs":206001,"endMs":210001,"text":"And so David's ready for bed at just about the usual time."},{"startMs":211000,"endMs":216001,"text":"Of course, he sometimes stays up later, but that doesn't happen often enough to change his going to bed habits."},{"startMs":218000,"endMs":223000,"text":"Now to sleep. Some people go right to sleep, others take longer."},{"startMs":223001,"endMs":228001,"text":"Because David has regular sleeping habits, he usually drops off very quickly."},{"startMs":243000,"endMs":247001,"text":"David has probably never stopped to think what a wonderful thing sleep is."},{"startMs":248000,"endMs":253001,"text":"In sleep, the muscles of the body are relaxed. It's the most perfect way to relax that we have."},{"startMs":254001,"endMs":259001,"text":"Our breathing is slower and deeper when we sleep. The body's temperature is lower."},{"startMs":260000,"endMs":264001,"text":"Even the heart beats more slowly. The whole body is resting."},{"startMs":265001,"endMs":272000,"text":"To rest all our muscles, we turn in our sleep. Some people turn often, others not so often, but we all do it."},{"startMs":272001,"endMs":275000,"text":"It's a normal part of sound, healthy sleep."},{"startMs":276000,"endMs":280001,"text":"Dreams are normal too. Often they're suggested by things around us while we sleep."},{"startMs":321001,"endMs":329001,"text":"Dreams don't seem to make much sense, do they? That's because the brain is resting along with the body, so it's less alert when you sleep."},{"startMs":342000,"endMs":346001,"text":"After a good night's sleep, you usually wake up easily and naturally."},{"startMs":356000,"endMs":361000,"text":"The alarm hasn't rung yet. David finds that he usually wakes up before it goes off."},{"startMs":363000,"endMs":369001,"text":"Of course, it takes him a little while to get fully awake. You're never at your best until at least an hour or two afterwards."},{"startMs":370000,"endMs":372001,"text":"That's one reason why getting up early is so important."},{"startMs":379000,"endMs":384001,"text":"There's plenty of time for breakfast too. Breakfast is an important meal that shouldn't be missed."},{"startMs":385000,"endMs":392000,"text":"If you usually go to bed early enough, you usually wake up early too. You can start the day in a pleasant, unhurried way."},{"startMs":392001,"endMs":396001,"text":"It's more fun for you that way and more fun for the rest of the family too."},{"startMs":397001,"endMs":401001,"text":"David and Martha enjoy their mornings, and that helps them enjoy the whole day."},{"startMs":412001,"endMs":417000,"text":"As the day goes on, you get more and more value from your regular sleeping habits."},{"startMs":417001,"endMs":422000,"text":"Plenty of sleep helps you to be bright and alert to the very end of the day."},{"startMs":425000,"endMs":430000,"text":"But what about bad sleeping habits? George just doesn't get enough sleep."},{"startMs":430001,"endMs":435000,"text":"Now, in the afternoon, he's tired. It's hard for him to pay attention in class."},{"startMs":436001,"endMs":441001,"text":"When the teacher calls on him, George just can't seem to remember things that he really ought to know."},{"startMs":442000,"endMs":447001,"text":"George doesn't realize it, but his main trouble is bad sleeping habits. Last night, for instance..."},{"startMs":447001,"endMs":451000,"text":"No, no, Muggsy. Don't rub me out. I didn't do it. Honest, I didn't."},{"startMs":451000,"endMs":453001,"text":"No, Rat's gonna squeal on me. You know too much, Limpy."},{"startMs":454000,"endMs":456001,"text":"You know I wouldn't sing, Muggsy. We've been past too long."},{"startMs":456001,"endMs":458001,"text":"Slats saw you in the DA's office."},{"startMs":458001,"endMs":461001,"text":"Sure, I was there, but they didn't get nothing out of me."},{"startMs":461001,"endMs":463000,"text":"Then why was the coppers around here today?"},{"startMs":463001,"endMs":465001,"text":"I don't know, Muggsy. I don't know."},{"startMs":465001,"endMs":468000,"text":"Just squeal. That's why. You put the finger on me."},{"startMs":468000,"endMs":471000,"text":"You can't do it, Muggsy. You can't. You can't."},{"startMs":471001,"endMs":482001,"text":"Yes, George has bad sleeping habits."},{"startMs":483000,"endMs":487000,"text":"And even when he finally does get into bed, he finds it hard to go to sleep."},{"startMs":488000,"endMs":492001,"text":"That's because he hasn't formed the habit of going to sleep at a regular time each night."},{"startMs":496000,"endMs":500001,"text":"And it's just as hard for him to wake up in the morning."},{"startMs":501001,"endMs":502001,"text":"George! George!"},{"startMs":511000,"endMs":511001,"text":"[...]"},{"startMs":511001,"endMs":513000,"text":"Get up, George!"},{"startMs":516001,"endMs":520001,"text":"He's still tired because he hasn't had enough sleep."},{"startMs":534001,"endMs":537000,"text":"Hey, Mom! Where are my books?"},{"startMs":537000,"endMs":538000,"text":"On the mantle, dear."},{"startMs":540000,"endMs":541001,"text":"George, close the door."},{"startMs":545000,"endMs":550001,"text":"The morning starts badly, and the whole day goes badly when you get too little sleep too often."},{"startMs":557000,"endMs":563000,"text":"And even after class is over, you keep on paying the penalty for bad sleeping habits."},{"startMs":565000,"endMs":570001,"text":"You don't have much fun when you're tired and low in energy."},{"startMs":571001,"endMs":573001,"text":"Lack of sleep makes it hard for you to do your best."},{"startMs":574001,"endMs":578001,"text":"You just can't seem to get into the game and have fun the way the other fellas do."},{"startMs":583001,"endMs":587000,"text":"You're irritable and cross, hard to get along with."},{"startMs":589001,"endMs":595001,"text":"People don't like you, and you don't like yourself when you're like that."},{"startMs":597000,"endMs":603001,"text":"Probably neither David nor George realize how important their sleeping habits are to the way they enjoy their waking hours."},{"startMs":604000,"endMs":612001,"text":"Going to bed at a regular time each night makes it easier for you to go right off to sleep instead of lying awake long into the night."},{"startMs":615001,"endMs":620000,"text":"You wake up easily and naturally without having to be dragged out of bed."},{"startMs":622000,"endMs":626001,"text":"And most important, your day starts right and stays right."},{"startMs":627000,"endMs":633001,"text":"Both David and Martha have learned that good sleeping habits help you get the most out of everyday living."}]}